[{"code":"not_implemented","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":27,"col":13},"end":{"line":27,"col":20}},"title":"NOT IMPLEMENTED YET","message":"A limit of the compiler: key `Run` writes the whole model with `f model`, a call\nof `f`, a function a pattern or a `let` binds, which the compiler knows only as\na value, so the compiler cannot tell which of the model's fields change\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5, class 4). Write each change in\n`update` itself — a message per change, each writing its fields — and the\nbindings it reaches follow. The program is valid: it builds with\n`--platform=browser-tea`."}]
